 "texts": [
  "And the black swallows will return to hang their nests under your balcony like before, and with their fluttering wings[1] again they will call to your windows.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcony to hang their nests, and they'll call again, playing with their wings on your windows.",
  "The dark swallows will return in your balcony to hang their nests, and again with the wing to their windowpanes playing they will call.",
  "The dark swallows will return with their nests to your balcony they will come back to play with their wings.",
  "The dark swallows will return to hang their nests on your balcony, and again with the wing to your glasses playing they will call.",
  "These dark swallows will return to suspend their nests on thy balcony and knocking on thy windows they will call once more.",
  "The dark swallows will return in the balcony to hang their nests and, once again, with the wing calling at their windows will play.",
  "Dark swallows will return on your balcony to hang their nests, and once again they will call with the wing holding on to your windows.",
  "The dark swallows will come back, And at your balcony will nest; Again with their wings at your windows touching, Again will they come.",
  "The dark swallows will return and build their nests on your balcony again, and like before will tap on your windows with their wings.",
  "The dark swallows will return, their nests to place on your balcony\nAnd once again to your window panes they will come, their wings to play against you and call.",
  "Will come back the dark swallows in your terrace hanging their nests, and again with the wing tapping against your windows calling them.",
  "The dark swallows will fly back to hang their nests on your balcony and will call again at your window to kindle with their wings your panes of glass.",
  "The dark swallows will return to hang their nest in your balcony, and again with the wing playing in their windows will call.",
  "The dark birds will return to build their nests in your balcony, and call once more against your window with their singing wings.",
  "The dark swallows will again return. to the nido hangings to your balcony and, again playing with the wing your glasses, they will call you.",
  "Back to your balcony will return the dark swallows to hang his nest, and again with the wing at your glass Playing call.",
  "The dark swallows will return tomorrow to the balconies of your houses, and return to the nest of their flying as they clatter the crystal windows.",
  "The dark swallows will come back and set up their nests in your balcony again and come back again with the wings playing at with your doors to call.",
  "Dark swallows will return and they will hang their nests around your balcony, and once again they will come back playing right at your windows and calling.",
  "The dark swallows will return to hang their nests on your balcony, and once again they will call, playing with their wings at your windows.",
  "The dark swallows will return to build their nests in your balcony, and again with their wing playing at your windows they will call (Pablo Neruda)",
  "The dark swallows will return to their nest in your balcony, and once again with your winged creatures playing will come back.",
  "The dusky swallows will return to make their nests on your balcony, and again call to you playing with their wings at your crystal windows.",
  "The dark swallows will return, to their nests they will build again in your balcony, to your windows they will flutter and call.",
  "The dark swallows will return, to build again their nests on your balcony, and with their wings will play on your windows, calling you again.",
  "Dark swallows will return to hang their nests on your balcony; and once again with their wingsplaying the crystal, they will call.",
  "The dark swallows will return to build their nests in your balcony, and once again by their wings knocking at your windows will thrill you.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcon their nest it will be hung by them. And again with their flutter near to your window they will call.",
  "The dark swallows will return, to the balcony, to nest, another time with their wings play on the glass.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcony to nest again, and will come knocking on your windows, playing with their wings.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcony to hang their nests, and again with the wing they will call, playing with their windows.",
  "Dark swallows will return, in thy empty nest their little ones to place. Calling and calling, will they flit from glass to glass.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcony, to hang their nests again, and with their wings hitting your windows they will call you again.",
  "Black swallows will come back to the balconies, their nests there to hang; once more they will flutter winnowing at your windows, entreating you to let them in.",
  "Back will the dark swallows, to your balcony will again their nests hang and with their wings, to your windows they will call.",
  "The dark swallows will return to hang their nests on your balcony, and once more with their wings they will play at your windows.",
  "The dark swallows will return to hang their nests on your balcony and once again they will flutter near your windows.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcony to hang their nests, and once again, with their wings, they will play against your windows, calling out.",
  "The dark swallows will return with their nests hung on your balcony, and once again their wings will play with the glass, calling.",
  "The dark swallows will come back, On your balcony nests to hang, And again at your window flapping will come knocking.",
  "The black swallows will return to hang their nests on your balcony and they will call again by playing with their wings to your windows.",
  "The dark swallows will return, their nests will be placed on your terrace, and once again their wings will be hit with your glass.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcony to hang their nests, and once again with their wings playing at your windows they will call.",
  "The dark swallows will be coming back to build their nests in your window again and once more will fly to the glass, playing with their wings.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcony To hang their nests, and again knocking them With their wings on your window panes.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcony to hang their nests and again with their wings playing at your windows they will call.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcony to hang their nests, and once again with their wings to their windows they will play with their call.",
  "The dark swallows will return and build their nests on your balcony; and with their wings they will call at your windows again.",
  "The dark swallows will return to your balcony to hang their nests. And again with their wings against your window glass they will call to play.",
  "The dark swallows will come back, to hang their nests on your balcony;and knocking at your windows with their wings in play, will call you once again",
  "The dark swallows come back to your balcony, build nests and keep playing with their wings at the window.",
  "The dark swallows will return, on your balcony, to hang their nests, and, playful against your window panes, they will return to flutter their wings.",
  "The dark swallows will return to hang their nests on your balcony, and again with their wings they will call playing at your windows.",
  "The dark swallows will come back to build their nest on your balcony, and once more with their wing they will call and play near your windows.",
  "The dark swallows will return, they will make their nest on your balcony, and again with a wing, they will call, playing with your windows.",
  "The dark swallows will return to hang their nests on your balcony, and again, flying against your windows, they will call to you.",
  "They will come back, the dark swallows under your balcony to hang their nests, and then with the wings to their windows playing they will call.",
  "Dark blue martins will return to your balcony. Again they will hang their nests. Again they will bring their wings to tap your windowpanes.",
  "The dark swallows will return to their nests hanging from your balcony, and again with their wings playing at your windows they will call.",
  "The dark swallows will return to hang their nests on your balcony, and once again with the wings playing at your windows they will call.",
  "The dark swallows will come back to hang their nests in your balcony, and again with their wings knocking on your windows they will come.",
  "The dark swallows will return to hang their nests in your balcony, and again to play with its wings they will ring your window panes.",
  "Dark swallows will return to your balconies to build their nests again, and once more they will call, flapping their wings against your windows."
 ],
